      "text": "**Calculating multiples**\n\nI need to calculate the multiples of 3 below 100, which would total 33. Then, for multiples of 7, it’s 14. But I notice that both share a common multiple of 21, which counts as 4. So, I want to ensure these are exclusive multiples, which leads me to the calculation: 33 plus 14 minus 2 times 4. That gives me a total of 39. Looks like I’m ready to move forward with that!"
